BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 755.00 Tm (THE BIG MONEY PLAYBOOKS) Tj ET
0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (volume to multiple clients and can be locked in on a weekly basis [LearnCargo - 703O5MjUp9A @ 00:01:01].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Make direct facility relationships your priority from day one, since the biggest income jump comes from cutting out the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (middleman, not from longer hours at the same rate [MONEY CENTRAL - GN6voRihdrc @ 00:05:59].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm (3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 641.10 Tm (Where Practitioners Disagree & Alternative Playbooks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 618.87 Tm (The sharpest split is whether STAT work is a standalone lane or a bolt-on. LearnCargo pitches STAT as a full platform:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 603.65 Tm (urgent, last-minute deliveries, open to any hour, effectively on call 24/7, and paid more precisely because of that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 588.42 Tm (urgency, with the stated secret being to stack as many certifications as possible so you qualify when a run drops) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 573.20 Tm ([703O5MjUp9A @ 00:02:05]. Medical Courier Connection rejects the either-or framing outright. Their argument is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 557.97 Tm (that the goal is not to choose between routes and STAT, but to understand how they work together: a scheduled route) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 542.75 Tm (buys you predictability, defined stops, and a predetermined rate, while a STAT pickup a few miles from where the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 527.52 Tm (route already has you scheduled becomes revenue layered onto miles you were going to drive anyway) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 512.30 Tm ([qLWRmpKkEP0 @ 00:01:13]. MONEY CENTRAL pushes the standalone model to its extreme in organ work,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 497.07 Tm (describing runs that are genuinely urgent, often at 2:00 in the morning on zero notice, where the top earners reportedly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 481.85 Tm (hit 60 to $77,000 a year depending on how much of the middle-of-the-night premium work they are willing to absorb) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 466.62 Tm ([GN6voRihdrc @ 00:02:10]. So the contrast is concrete: one camp sells availability as the product, the other sells route) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 451.40 Tm (density and treats STAT as an optimization layer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 436.17 Tm (The second fault line is employment structure. HNL Lab Medicine runs the in-house model at scale and sells it hard:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 420.95 Tm (on-the-job training, excellent benefits even for part-time couriers, a 24/7 operation with multiple shifts, and a hybrid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 405.72 Tm (company vehicle so couriers put no wear and tear on their personal cars, with one courier reporting 10 years on the job) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 390.50 Tm ([C1dIA8HJSJc @ 00:02:52]. MONEY CENTRAL treats that same employee seat as an apprenticeship at $16 to $22 an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 375.27 Tm (hour and argues the single biggest income jump comes from switching to independent contractor and landing direct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 360.05 Tm (hospital and transplant-center contracts, cutting out the courier company taking a cut; direct-contract couriers report 28) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 344.82 Tm (to $65 an hour or more, and three or more facility contracts reportedly yield 5,000 to $9,000 a month on a setup cost of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 329.60 Tm (roughly 300 to $600 [GN6voRihdrc @ 00:03:18]. LearnCargo agrees the money is real but slows the timeline: cold) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 314.37 Tm (chain gigs typically require relationships and experience, and the couriers posting 1,500 to $5,000 weeks have been at it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 299.15 Tm (for years, carry certifications, and hold insurance covering damage to specimens [703O5MjUp9A @ 00:03:58].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 283.92 Tm (Translation for an operator: the direct-contract path pays, but the employee years are how you buy the relationships.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 268.70 Tm (Practitioners also split on how much paper you need. LearnCargo runs a maximalist list of ten: HIPAA, OSHA 10,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 253.47 Tm (OSHA 30, bloodborne pathogens, hazmat awareness, infection control, defensive driving, chain-of-custody, cold chain,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 238.25 Tm (and a DOT medical card, plus a bonus TWIC card to open government contracts and locations other couriers cannot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 223.02 Tm (reach [A55v_6-hvG0 @ 00:01:51]. Markie Williams narrows the core to two, HIPAA and OSHA bloodborne pathogen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 207.80 Tm (training, pitching free online courses where you pay only for the certificate if you need it, and arguing clients prioritize) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.57 Tm (contractors holding the necessary certifications [WizhPVJ0zVE @ 00:01:13]. On gear, the split is who pays. Medical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 177.35 Tm (Courier Connection warns that not all medical clients provide coolers and tells couriers to stock their own spill kit,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 162.12 Tm (extra baggies, gloves, and alcohol-based rubs in the cooler side pouch, while explicitly not recommending gloves at all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 146.90 Tm (times when handling specimens [oF-_Ka8kNzk @ 00:01:29]. Moore Business & Tax Solutions describes the opposite) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 131.67 Tm (at Rapid Medical, a veterinarian route, where onboarding shipped the insulated biohazard bag, vest, hat, branded shirts,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 116.45 Tm (baggies, ice packs, and a badge printed with steps to a perfect pickup [mdF3PItHYxc @ 00:02:28]. Budget for your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 101.22 Tm (own kit until a client proves it ships one.) Tj ET
