BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (formed, through the NPPES portal, free, with a two-to-five-business-day turnaround; most NEMT companies register a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (Type 2 organizational NPI to the LLC rather than a Type 1 individual number, and select the van-transport taxonomy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (code they give as 34390000X [dLgmDQavyEU @ 00:04:22]. RouteGenie clocks the online NPPES application at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (about 20 minutes, with the number arriving within 10 days, and stresses accuracy because errors surface later as delays) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (and claim rejections [3Z74zrMSRtA @ 00:03:09]. Nemiton's state Medicaid packet checklist covers the signed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (provider agreement, which they say to read because it is a contract and not a formality, an ACH form for direct deposit,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (TIN and EIN verification, copies of every business, driver, and vehicle license, proof of insurance meeting state) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (minimums, and NPI confirmation [qijT2a0o9VE @ 00:02:48]. Nemt University's walkthrough of the New York form) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (shows how deep the disclosure goes: business name, NPI, EIN, and for each owner the name, title, date of birth,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (ownership percentage, and Social Security number, plus questions on whether anyone has been terminated, denied) Tj ET
