BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 532.00 Tm (Section 4: Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 509.77 Tm (Cash timing, not demand, is the trap that kills most first-year operators. Nemiton warns that Medicaid pays in 30 to 60) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 494.55 Tm (days, that billing can drag 45 to 90 days after the trip, and that manual billing becomes unmanageable past 20 trips a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 479.32 Tm (month. The floor, per Nemiton, is 90 days of operating cash on hand [w246jND2Ahw @ 00:06:12]. NEMT Launch) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 464.10 Tm (Blueprint gives the calendar version: trips run in January may not pay until March, and that gap is what kills new) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 448.87 Tm (businesses, so budget for the reserve before launch [4_YiCCE47fY @ 00:04:54]. Joe Padilla lived the worst case. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 433.65 Tm ($15K receivable went unpaid. Nursing homes pay in about 30 days while contracts take 40 to 60. A client running) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 418.42 Tm (3,000 to 4,000 trips a day had roughly $1M frozen when a broker went bankrupt, and Padilla sold a truck for $15K just) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 403.20 Tm (to make payroll. Padilla's fix is standing lines of credit [g6k_yncRR8o @ 00:23:38]. Shantasia_RN names the mental) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.97 Tm (error behind all of this: treating the bank balance as available money. Money in the business account is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 372.75 Tm (automatically owner income. Reconcile billed trips against paid trips every cycle, and before any big move ask what) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 357.52 Tm (happens if revenue arrives late [fWyD2LyLaKE @ 00:07:29].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 342.30 Tm (Insurance is where bad paperwork becomes bankruptcy. Nemiton cites a Florida operator carrying $1M in coverage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.07 Tm (who faced a $1.4M accident and went under. Nemiton pegs per-vehicle premiums from about $3,500 rural to $7,500 in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 311.85 Tm (a major metro [w246jND2Ahw @ 00:04:38]. JT Automations warns that claiming personal use to shave premiums) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 296.62 Tm (backfires: claims get denied and the carrier drops you. JT's budget is $3,000 to $10,000 a year for commercial auto,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 281.40 Tm (general liability of at least $1M, recommended professional liability, and workers' comp [dHKhNi-IC-0 @ 00:11:17].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 266.17 Tm (Joe Padilla started on a commercial Progressive policy that turned out not to cover door-to-door service [g6k_yncRR8o) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 250.95 Tm (@ 00:17:49]. Er Fukuda had the EIN and NPI ready but watched insurance delay the launch, then had one broker push) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 235.72 Tm (a taxi policy onto the company. Fukuda's lesson is to read every contract and shop around. Rainbow Road's stack runs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 220.50 Tm (general liability, commercial auto, sexual abuse and molestation, umbrella, and cyber, with cyber at $1,300 a year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 205.27 Tm (against other quotes near $1,500 [r-1ofTEk2SU @ 00:19:04]. Every one of these losses traces back to buying a policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 190.05 Tm (without matching it to the actual service being run.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 174.82 Tm (The third trap is assuming a signature, a van or a driver equals revenue. Joe Padilla's Rancho Mirage account had an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 159.60 Tm (administrator sign and then send zero trips for three weeks. Winning the calls was 'your responsibility,' so Padilla) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 144.37 Tm (showed up with donuts and a mariachi band and now coaches students to visit across shifts, including Saturdays) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 129.15 Tm ([g6k_yncRR8o @ 00:09:50]. ThatNEMTGirl bought a low-roof 15-passenger Sprinter that could not be converted. To) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 113.92 Tm (keep it earning, they ran casino trips to North Carolina and Alabama, and it took nine months to fund a real wheelchair) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 98.70 Tm (van [5gdeSbLFdzk @ 00:18:49]. The WM NEMT Startup Coach host lost a MotiveCare contract outright. As a felon,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 83.47 Tm (the host could not drive, and the hired driver ruined the brakes within two weeks. That is why guest John Meli insists) Tj ET
