BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (They offset fuel by charging for mileage on longer runs to Matthews and Concord [nSB43YYfRs0 @ 00:06:40]. Nemt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (University warns financed buyers to confirm during market research that revenue can cover both the note and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (insurance, because those can get quite expensive [VGWUx-p8MbM @ 00:05:43]. RouteGenie flags a used-market trap) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (that bites budget buyers. The Dodge Grand Caravan was sold exclusively as a fleet vehicle in its final years, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (extremely low prices might signal poor condition; used 2019 units normally run $13,000 to $16,000 [uJV2f3MOJbI @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (00:03:21]. Run the payment, insurance, and mileage math before signing, not after the first slow month.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (The second trap is the dead mile. LearnCargo says the cancellation call almost never comes. Nine times out of 10, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (driver finds out at the last minute on their own, sometimes because the broker never passed the cancellation along. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (fix is calling the broker to get a note placed on that client's account after driving 30 miles for nothing [MOdO2Zzw1wI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (@ 00:01:02]. RouteGenie frames the cost as scheduling gaps and lost revenue. It estimates that an operator facing more) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (than one no-show a month could be losing upwards of a thousand dollars monthly, and cites research tying up to 31.5%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (of no-shows to poor provider communication [R4q_XZ1pARQ @ 00:01:59]. Its cancellation playbook asks passengers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (to cancel at least 24 hours before pickup, and gives the example of a $25 fee on a $100 trip canceled within 24 hours. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (warns that disputes over no-show charges are common unless the policy is written, published, and enforced) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (consistently, with fee waivers spelled out in advance [d8ocN3ERJag @ 00:04:22]. MJ Business Academy shows the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (field version. Their client agreed to pay wait time if not outside at the 10:30 pickup, so the clock starts the moment the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (van arrives and the client is not ready [ohTDpW0zUS8 @ 00:05:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (The third trap is buying a van that turns trips away or fails mid-run. MJ Business Academy, five years into operating,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (says rehabilitation center patients often ride with leg extenders that a smaller wheelchair van cannot fit, so that is one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (trip you will have to turn away. The same tight cabin blocks multi-loading and husband-and-wife wheelchair pairs. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (also leaves the wheelchair parked where it takes the brunt of a rear impact [P_pN6quM3G4 @ 00:03:02]. Jasmine and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (Monica also show how thin punctuality margins are. They rolled up to St. JW Medical Plaza one minute late for a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (10:30 pickup with a client who likes them on time, blaming a business call that ran long [ohTDpW0zUS8 @ 00:02:34].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (Cleanup is another hidden failure point. Their full cut Caravan has no carpet because clients have accidents and leak) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (bodily fluids, so the floor wipes clean [rIDRpTROLM8 @ 00:01:32]. NEMT Growth Machine stocks a duffel with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (gloves, N95 masks, a first aid kit, and a bloodborne pathogen spill kit. The van also carries a jack, a spare tire, and) Tj ET
