BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (but they disagree on how far to trust it. Run Bambi Run drafts a full day in under 30 seconds and leaves stretcher trips) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (visibly unassigned when capacity does not exist, yet Bambi's own knowledge base still has dispatchers build) Tj ET
